  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment supports Tonga Police to achieve its vision of a safe, secure, and crime-free Tonga through support for priority infrastructure, training and equipment, including an upgraded case management system, renovated facilities to uphold dignity of those held in custody, and improved capability in marine search and rescue. The investment is managed by Tonga Police and funding is provided through earmarked budget support.</narrative>
